  "title": "Grilled Sea Bass with Chili-Lime Dressing",
  "description": "Just mix up a simple Asian-inspired spicy lime dressing, grill some sea bass fillets, and serve the fish drizzled with the sauce for a quick and brightly flavored summer meal.",
